e as a forensic consultant, where she's developed a formidable reputation as both a corpse magnet and detective.\n\nAssisting her in these tasks is young Shoutarou Tatewaki, who is no slouch at sleuthing himself, though his primary task is to keep Sakurako focused (and keep her from occasionally \"borrowing\" a particularly interesting specimen). If there's a bone to pick, a stray skull to be found, or a random skeleton hidden in a closet, you can trust this team to unearth the evidence.\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Detective","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Crime","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":67,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Age Gap","rank":42,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Suicide","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Police","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Beautiful Bones -Sakurako's Investigation-","english":"Beautiful Bones -Sakurako's Investigation-","native":"櫻子さんの足下には死体が埋まっている","romaji":"Sakurako-san no Ashimoto ni wa Shitai ga Umatteiru","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"樱子小姐的脚下埋着尸体"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"樱子小姐的脚下埋着秘密"}]},"trailer":{"id":"svVuXiVnNh8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/svVuXiVnNh8/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}